@startuml
title Smartresponsor v30.x — Self-Learning Federation

[PolicyFlow] --> [Adaptive Learning]
[Adaptive Learning] --> [Feedback DB]
[Feedback DB] --> [CrossRegionSync] : export
[CrossRegionSync] ..> [MetricsSigner]
[Scheduler] --> [Federation Push] : canary
[Federation Push] --> [Peers]
[Peers] --> [Federation Learning API] : apply
[Federation Learning API] --> [Federation Learner] : update alpha/beta
[Federation Learner] --> [Policy Variants]

@enduml
